WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.482
Welcome to Module 12. This module focuses on data cleaning and exploratory data analysis.

00:00:07.482 --> 00:00:13.927
Before formal analysis or modeling, we need to understand missingness, duplicate records,

00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:21.422
incorrect data types, inconsistent categories, unusual values, and the general shape of the data.
